{"translation-revision-date":"2026-07-06","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"public\/bundle.settings.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"de_DE","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"webhead Search Cloud":["webhead Search Cloud"],"(unknown)":["(unbekannt)"],"Featured":["Hervorgehoben"],"Trigger":["Trigger"],"Popular searches":["Beliebte Suchanfragen"],"Excerpt":["Auszug"],"Published date":["Ver\u00f6ffentlichungsdatum"],"Author":["Autor"],"Connection failed.":["Verbindung fehlgeschlagen."],"No content types are enabled for indexing yet.":["Es sind noch keine Inhaltstypen f\u00fcr die Indexierung aktiviert."],"Sync started.":["Synchronisierung gestartet."],"Title":[""],"Upgrade your plan on Search Cloud (opens in a new tab)":[""],"Upgrade plan":[""],"Edit the JSON value for this setting.":[""],"No settings are registered for this tab yet.":[""],"Cache":[""],"Clears this plugin's own cached data and PHP's opcode cache, so a just-changed setting or a recently updated card template\/popular-search result shows up immediately instead of waiting for it to expire on its own.":[""],"Cache cleared.":[""],"Could not clear the cache.":[""],"Clearing\u2026":[""],"Clear cache":[""],"Learn more":[""],"How connecting to Search Cloud works":[""],"Clicking Connect sends the email address shown below (or the one you enter under \"Use a different email\") to Search Cloud, along with this site's address.":[""],"If that email has no Search Cloud account yet, one is created automatically and this site is connected right away - no further steps.":[""],"If that email already has a Search Cloud account, nothing is created or changed yet. Search Cloud emails a confirmation link to that address; once its owner clicks it, they choose which account to connect this site to. Come back here afterwards and paste the resulting keys into \"Advanced: manual key entry\" below.":[""],"Accepting the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy is required to continue. Accepting the Data Processing Agreement is optional.":[""],"Terms of Service":[""],"Privacy Policy":[""],"Data Processing Agreement":[""],"Connected - %1$s \/ %2$s documents indexed.":[""],"unlimited":[""],"Connected.":[""]," (site #%d)":[""],"Saving\u2026":[""],"Save connection":[""],"No unsaved changes.":[""],"Enter the credentials from your site page in the Search Cloud app. The write key and secret are stored encrypted and never sent to the browser in clear text.":[""],"Search key":[""],"Public key (sk_...) used by the browser, restricted by your domain allowlist.":[""],"Write key":[""],"A write key is saved. Leave blank to keep it, or enter a new one to rotate.":[""],"Server-side write key (wk_...).":[""],"Write secret":[""],"A write secret is saved. Leave blank to keep it, or enter a new one to rotate.":[""],"Server-side write secret.":[""],"Connection settings saved.":[""],"Could not save the connection settings.":[""],"The test request failed.":[""],"Testing\u2026":[""],"Test connection":[""],"Test uses your saved credentials - save first.":[""],"The connection request failed.":[""],"Connecting\u2026":[""],"Connect to Search Cloud":[""],"Search Cloud connection":[""],"Connect this site to webhead Search Cloud to start syncing content and enable search.":[""],"Disconnect":[""],"Hide advanced options":[""],"Advanced: manual key entry \/ rotate keys":[""],"Disconnected from Search Cloud.":[""],"Could not disconnect.":[""],"This removes the saved connection credentials from this site only. It does not delete or change anything in your Search Cloud account.":[""],"An account already exists for %s. Check that inbox for a confirmation link, finish connecting on the Search Cloud dashboard, then paste the resulting keys below.":[""],"Accept the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy to continue.":[""],"I accept the":[""],"and":[""],"(required)":[""],"(optional)":[""],"You'll connect using %s. A new Search Cloud account is created if it doesn't have one yet; otherwise this site connects to its existing account.":[""],"An admin email is required to connect.":[""],"Use the default email instead":[""],"Not this email?":[""],"Email":[""],"Your name (optional)":[""],"Company name (optional)":[""],"Used as the Search Cloud account name.":[""],"Advanced: manual key entry":[""],"Custom field":[""],"Taxonomy":[""],"Built-in field":[""],"Modified date":[""],"Slug":[""],"Taxonomy: %s":[""],"- Do not send -":[""],"Send as":[""],"From":[""],"Value":[""],"- Select -":[""],"Taxonomy slug":[""],"Meta key":[""],"Remove field":[""],"Activate WooCommerce to index product data.":[""],"WooCommerce %1$s is below the supported minimum %2$s. Product fields are disabled until WooCommerce is updated.":[""],"Price":[""],"Regular & sale price":[""],"SKU":[""],"Variation SKUs":[""],"Stock status":[""],"Categories":[""],"Tags":[""],"Average rating":[""],"Review count":[""],"Product details":[""],"Pick which WooCommerce data to send. Variable products are indexed once (as the parent) with a price range.":[""],"Only index published, visible products":[""],"Recommended. Hidden or draft products stay out of search.":[""],"Product attributes":[""],"Each selected attribute is sent as its own field (attr_{name}) so it can be made searchable.":[""],"Add %s to search":[""],"When on, your %s are sent to Search Cloud and appear in search results.":[""],"What appears in results":[""],"Choose where each part of a search result comes from. The defaults work for most sites.":[""],"The main heading of each result. Required.":[""],"Body text":[""],"The text Search Cloud looks through for matches.":[""],"Result link":[""],"Where clicking a result takes the visitor.":[""],"Thumbnail image":[""],"Image shown next to each result.":[""],"Options":[""],"Include a short summary (excerpt)":[""],"Also index private & password-protected items":[""],"Off by default.":[""],"Show advanced options":[""],"Type label":[""],"How this content is grouped and filtered in search. Most sites can leave this as the default.":[""],"Type":[""],"Extra fields":[""],"Send additional data (a custom field, a taxonomy, or a built-in field) under a name you choose.":[""],"Add a field":[""],"Save indexing configuration":[""],"What to index":[""],"Turn on the content you want to be searchable and choose which information is sent for each. Changes take effect after the next sync.":[""],"Sending a field here makes the data available. To let visitors search by it, also enable that field (with a weight) in the Search Config tab.":[""],"Indexing configuration saved.":[""],"Could not save the indexing configuration.":[""],"%d content type will be indexed.":[""],"Completed":[""],"Failed":[""],"Cancelled":[""],"Running":[""],"Paused":[""],"Queued":[""],"Manual":[""],"Scheduled":[""],"Incremental":[""],"Run":[""],"Status":[""],"Processed":[""],"Pushed":[""],"Deleted":[""],"Started":[""],"Delete":[""],"Sync history":[""],"Finished runs cleared.":[""],"Could not clear the history.":[""],"Clear finished":[""],"Start sync?":[""],"This sends new and changed content to Search Cloud. Continue?":[""],"Start sync":[""],"Re-sync everything?":[""],"This re-sends your entire catalog to Search Cloud, ignoring what\u2019s already indexed. It can take a while and uses more of your document quota. Continue?":[""],"Re-sync everything":[""],"Cancel this sync?":[""],"This stops the current run. Progress made so far is kept, and you can start a new sync anytime. Continue?":[""],"Cancel sync":[""],"That action could not be completed.":[""],"Sync":[""],"Send your content to Search Cloud. Only new and changed items are sent on each run, so repeat syncs are fast.":[""],"Add and save your Search Cloud credentials first.":[""],"Go to Connection":[""],"Go to Indexing":[""],"Full re-sync":[""],"%d items processed\u2026":[""],"%1$s of ~%2$s processed (%3$d%%)":[""],"Skipped":[""],"Pause":[""],"Resume":[""],"Cancel":[""],"Full re-sync started.":[""],"Not now":[""],"A fallback list of queries shown as suggestions in the search modal before a visitor types anything. Search Cloud's own live popular searches are used whenever available; this list only takes over when that request comes back empty or fails.":[""],"One query per line. Used as a fallback whenever live popular searches from Search Cloud are unavailable or empty.":[""],"Preparing\u2026":[""],"Indexing\u2026":[""],"Ready":[""],"Your plan does not include this.":[""],"AI & ranking":[""],"Site-level switches that change how results are found and ordered. These are the same switches as in the Search Cloud panel.":[""],"AI search":[""],"Searches return hybrid keyword + semantic results. Turning this on starts a background re-index of your catalogue; turning it off is instant and keeps keyword search working.":[""],"Index status: %s":[""],"AI visual tagging":[""],"A vision model describes each product image and adds the tags to the document, so sparsely-described products still turn up. Applied as you sync \u2014 re-sync to tag products already indexed.":[""],"Rank results by what visitors click":[""],"Results people click most for a search rise for everyone searching it. Relevance still leads \u2014 popular results are only nudged up.":[""],"Merchandising rules":[""],"Curate the results of chosen searches. Leave the trigger empty to apply a rule to every search \u2014 that is how you keep a product out of search everywhere.":[""],"Trigger (search term contains)":[""],"Empty: this rule applies to every search on the site.":[""],"Remove rule":[""],"Pin to top (document ids)":[""],"Comma-separated, in the order they should appear.":[""],"Hide (document ids)":[""],"Comma-separated. Kept out of the results entirely.":[""],"Promotional banner":[""],"Optional message returned with the results for this search.":[""],"Add a rule":[""],"Could not load the search configuration.":[""],"Save search configuration":[""],"Search configuration":[""],"Controls how Search Cloud itself ranks and filters your content - which fields it searches and how heavily, per-type ranking boosts, which fields power facets and suggestions, and synonyms. Most of this lives on Search Cloud's side, not in this plugin's own settings, so changes take effect on the very next search.":[""],"Searchable fields & weights":[""],"Which fields full-text search matches, and how much each one counts (1\u2013100). A higher weight on \"title\" makes title matches outrank body-text matches, for example.":[""],"Field":[""],"Weight":[""],"Type boosts":[""],"Ranking boost per content type (0.1\u2013100). Above 1 ranks that type higher overall; below 1 ranks it lower. One row per content type currently enabled in Indexing.":[""],"Boost":[""],"Enable at least one content type in the Indexing tab to set a type boost.":[""],"Facet fields":[""],"Fields returned as facets on search results and allowed as filters. Click the field to browse every available field, or type to search.":[""],"Suggest fields":[""],"Fields queried for search-as-you-type suggestions. Defaults to \"title\" when left empty. Click to browse, or type to search.":[""],"Synonyms":[""],"Treats words as interchangeable during search, even when the exact word a visitor types never appears in a result. For example, a line with \"sneaker, trainer\" means searching \"sneaker\" also matches results that only mention \"trainer\", and vice versa - useful for regional spelling or naming differences.":[""],"One comma-separated group of interchangeable words per line, e.g. \"sneaker, trainer\".":[""],"Languages":[""],"Which of this site's languages to index and search. Your plan allows up to %d.":[""],"Which of this site's languages to index and search. Leave every language unchecked for unrestricted.":[""],"No WPML\/Polylang installation was detected, so languages can only be entered manually here. Leave empty for unrestricted.":[""],"Comma-separated ISO language codes, e.g. \"de, en\".":[""],"Could not save the search configuration.":[""],"Search configuration saved.":[""],"Indexing":[""],"Search Config":[""],"Connection":[""],"Saving...":[""],"Save Settings":[""],"Configure the plugin settings from one shared admin surface.":[""],"Settings saved successfully.":[""],"OK":[""],"The settings could not be saved. Review the fields and try again.":[""],"General":[""]}}}